{
    "title": "Dynamic View AZ",
    "description": "<b> Experience Dynamic View features on Android devices </b>\r\n\r\nWith Dynamic View AZ, you can check notifications and current activity in progress, such as music that\u2019s playing, timer, weather in the Dynamic View on the home screen or in any app. Dynamic View helps users easier access to controls with simple gestures without impeding content on the screen. Touch and hold the Dynamic View to expand it and see more details about the activity.\r\n\r\nDynamic View helps you to keep tab with your notifications with fun and smooth animations. You can personalize Dynamic View to make it more beautiful and fit your needs. Easily customize the Dynamic View with many different size, position, and much more.\r\n\r\n<b>FEATURE: </b>\r\n- Show incoming calls\r\n- Read and show notification on Dynamic View\r\n- Show music waveform, access music controls and a music player.\r\n- Show timer, alarm clock\r\n- Show charging information while charging\r\n- Display and keep track of weather\r\n- Display and quick access to the calendar\r\n- Fast, smooth, easy to use\r\n- Allows editing size, position of Dynamic\r\n- And more to come soon!\r\n\r\n<b>PERMISSION REQUIREMENT:</b>\r\n- QUERY_ALL_PACKAGED : to check, show and manager Apps notification can show on Dynamic View\r\n- OVERLAY PERMISSION : to manager overlay view and display Dynamic View on all of screen view\r\n- NOTIFICATION PERMISSION : to show notification on Dynamic View\r\n- ACCESSIBILITY PERMISSION : Set up and display the Dynamic, display and show more information weather, alarm, music notification view control. The application commits not to collect or share any user information about this accessibility right.\r\n\r\nBring beautiful Dynamic Bubble animations to your phone right now and explore more awesome features.\r\n\r\n<b>FEEDBACK:</b>\r\nWe hope you will like the app and support it. \ud83d\udc9a\r\nWe will be happy if you give your feedback to improve this application.\r\nIf you need help for using feature or have some suggestion, Please contact us via: support@appsgenz.com\r\nThank you so much for using my app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b> Experience Dynamic View features on Android devices </b><br><br>With Dynamic View AZ, you can check notifications and current activity in progress, such as music that\u2019s playing, timer, weather in the Dynamic View on the home screen or in any app. Dynamic View helps users easier access to controls with simple gestures without impeding content on the screen. Touch and hold the Dynamic View to expand it and see more details about the activity.<br><br>Dynamic View helps you to keep tab with your notifications with fun and smooth animations. You can personalize Dynamic View to make it more beautiful and fit your needs. Easily customize the Dynamic View with many different size, position, and much more.<br><br><b>FEATURE: </b><br>- Show incoming calls<br>- Read and show notification on Dynamic View<br>- Show music waveform, access music controls and a music player.<br>- Show timer, alarm clock<br>- Show charging information while charging<br>- Display and keep track of weather<br>- Display and quick access to the calendar<br>- Fast, smooth, easy to use<br>- Allows editing size, position of Dynamic<br>- And more to come soon!<br><br><b>PERMISSION REQUIREMENT:</b><br>- QUERY_ALL_PACKAGED : to check, show and manager Apps notification can show on Dynamic View<br>- OVERLAY PERMISSION : to manager overlay view and display Dynamic View on all of screen view<br>- NOTIFICATION PERMISSION : to show notification on Dynamic View<br>- ACCESSIBILITY PERMISSION : Set up and display the Dynamic, display and show more information weather, alarm, music notification view control. The application commits not to collect or share any user information about this accessibility right.<br><br>Bring beautiful Dynamic Bubble animations to your phone right now and explore more awesome features.<br><br><b>FEEDBACK:</b><br>We hope you will like the app and support it. \ud83d\udc9a<br>We will be happy if you give your feedback to improve this application.<br>If you need help for using feature or have some suggestion, Please contact us via: support@appsgenz.com<br>Thank you so much for using my app.",
